NOTICE

Earlier versions (through v0.1) of
skills/schedule-usage-reset-fallback/usage-reset.mjs ported credential reading
(keychain then file), token-expiry check, proxy tunnel, and usage-API call logic
from claude-hud (https://github.com/jarrodwatts/claude-hud), Copyright (c) Jarrod
Watts, licensed under the MIT License. As of v0.2 that code has been removed in
favor of Claude Code's own status line data, so no claude-hud-derived code
remains. Kept here as an acknowledgement.
